==Trivia==
*Crystal Ribbons are present in the contents of [[Volume 4]] and [[Volume 13]].
*Richeh's [[Palm Quire]] has a small casting seal drawn on it when casting this spell for Beldaruit. Although it's too unclear to make out the seal, it appears to have a Sigil of Earth.{{Ref|m|33|11-12}}
*It's likely that this spell only affects the consistency of the crystal and doesn't create the crystal itself.
*In addition to small seals, Crystal Ribbon (or Crystal spells in general) are likely one of Richeh's specialties.
**Riliphin is able to recognize Richeh's magic from her spells alone, claiming how "it sparkles like crystal and shines like the stars."{{Ref|m|70|16-21}}
**Crystal Ribbon is Richeh's most consistenly used spell in the series.
